<LegalLayout locale="en" title="Privacy Policy" description="Temporary file retention, session access, analytics and advertising providers used by DoctorConverter.">
  <p>This policy explains what is processed when you visit DoctorConverter and use its document tools. No account is required.</p>

  <nav aria-label="On this page" class="mb-8 border-y border-border py-4">
